<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20746" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρᾰβ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>act as judge</i> or <i>umpire</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῇ κληρώσει τὴν τύχην βραβεύσειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					7.23
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρθῶς β</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Axiop.
				2.7
			</span></i>; <i>preside</i> at an election, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cat.Mi.</u>
				44
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>arbitrate, decide on</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τῶν ἄλλων δίκαια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					3.27
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				9.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρίσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cic.</u>
					35
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δικαστήριον</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅμιλλαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.960a
				</span></i>
			, etc.: c. acc. et dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγῶνα ἰσχυρὸν ἐβράβευσεν αὐτῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Wi.</u>
					10.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσήκει βασιλεῖ τὰ δίκαια β. τοῖς
					ὑπηκόοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Muson.
					8p.33H.
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βραβευθήσεται τὰ τοῦ πολέμου τῷ
					νενικηκότι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					6.9.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ παρά τν ι βραβευόμενα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					5.70
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνέβη . . τὴν κρίσιν βραβευθῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					685.37
				</span></i>
			(Cret.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>direct, control,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Michel
				163.10
			</span></i>(<span class="entity">Delos</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				12.56
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοῦς β. πάντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.94
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.4.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pel.</u>
				13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντων ὑπὸ τοῦ δαιμονίου -ομένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Herc.</u>
					1251.7
				</span></i>
			.</div>
